<%# "Verbrauch" — the AI area's consumption page (doc/ki_bereich_navigation_plan.md S6,
    gap L8).

    The order of this page IS the fix. On the settings page the same three displays sat
    between an activation banner, a package catalogue and a provider form, with the token
    figure last and unexplained. L8's complaint was never that the numbers were wrong but
    that they put the wrong one first: tokens are our purchasing unit, credits are what
    the customer is measured against and what the gate enforces.

    So: credits (bar + banners), then the six-month Nachweis — which the Kontingent
    decision makes an obligation, not an ornament — and only then tokens, with the one
    sentence that says what they are for. %>
<div>
  <%= render 'organisations/shared/ai_area_header',
             title: t('views.organisations.ai_overview.usage.title') %>

  <p class="mb-8 max-w-3xl text-sm text-cream-700">
    <%= t('views.organisations.ai_overview.usage.intro') %>
  </p>

  <% if @organisation.ai_enabled? %>
    <%# ONE ledger for both partials — see AiUsagesController#show for why. %>
    <%= render 'shared/ai/quota_bar', organisation: @organisation, ledger: @ledger %>
    <%= render 'shared/ai/quota_history', organisation: @organisation, ledger: @ledger %>
  <% else %>
    <%# Not a blank page: the route is reachable by URL even while the hub locks its
        card, and "nothing here" would read as a defect rather than as a state. %>
    <%= render 'organisations/shared/ai_disabled_notice' %>
  <% end %>

  <%# Deliberately OUTSIDE the opt-in branch, exactly as it was on the settings page:
      these are calls that already happened. Switching AI off does not unmake them, and
      hiding them the moment the switch flips would lose the answer to "wofür ging das
      Kontingent drauf" precisely when somebody asks. %>
  <% if @usage_stats.any? %>
    <div class="mt-12 max-w-4xl">
      <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-cream-900">
        <i class="bi bi-bar-chart mr-2"></i>
        <%= t('views.organisations.ai_overview.usage.tokens_heading') %>
      </h3>
      <p class="mb-4 mt-1 text-sm text-cream-600">
        <%= t('views.organisations.ai_overview.usage.tokens_hint') %>
      </p>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 md:grid-cols-2">
        <% @usage_stats.each do |provider, tokens| %>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between rounded border border-cream-300 bg-cream-50 px-4 py-3">
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
              <i class="bi bi-<%= provider == AiCredential::PROVIDER_OPENAI ? 'cpu' : 'robot' %> text-cream-700"></i>
              <span class="text-sm font-medium text-cream-900">
                <%= AiCredential.provider_display_names[provider] %>
              </span>
            </div>
            <div class="text-sm font-semibold tabular-nums text-cream-900">
              <%= t('views.organisations.ai_overview.usage.tokens_value',
                    formatted: number_with_delimiter(tokens)) %>
            </div>
          </div>
        <% end %>
      </div>
    </div>
  <% end %>
</div>
